sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State CertificateInstalled<br>with certificateType CSMSRootCertificate

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a DeleteCertificateRequest

    CSMS->>CS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateType contains CSMSRootCertificate OR is omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsResponse (status = Accepted,<br>certificateHashDataChain[0].certificateType = CSMSRootCertificate,<br>certificateHashDataChain[0].certificateHashData.hashAlgorithm = SHA256)

    CSMS->>CS: DeleteCertificateRequest (certificateHashData)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateHashData contains<br>the certificateHashData returned at Step 2

    CS-->>CSMS: DeleteCertificateResponse (status = Failed)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
